  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "sub_006_trainer_01",
      "hash64": "B992376E5778CB1C",
      "text": "看来你打败了古鲁夏啊！\\n恭喜你获得道馆徽章！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "sub_006_trainer_02",
      "hash64": "B9923A6E5778D035",
      "text": "就算道馆的挑战结束后，\\n你还是可以在霜抹山\\r\\n自由地享受雪山速滑的乐趣。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "sub_006_trainer_03",
      "hash64": "B992396E5778CE82",
      "text": "要挑战雪山速滑吗？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "sub_006_trainer_04",
      "hash64": "B992346E5778C603",
      "text": "要挑战哪个赛道呢？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "sub_006_trainer_05",
      "hash64": "B992336E5778C450",
      "text": "细雪赛道啊！\\n悠然自在地滑吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "sub_006_trainer_06",
      "hash64": "B992366E5778C969",
      "text": "暴风雪赛道啊！\\n要稳扎稳打地滑哦！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "sub_006_trainer_07",
      "hash64": "B992356E5778C7B6",
      "text": "绝对零度赛道啊！\\n请做好心理准备再滑哦！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "sub_006_trainer_08",
      "hash64": "B992406E5778DA67",
      "text": "在霜抹山的大自然中，\\n骑着坐骑宝可梦在赛道上滑行！\\r\\n……仅此而已！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "sub_006_trainer_09",
      "hash64": "B9923F6E5778D8B4",
      "text": "有３种赛道可供选择！\\n只要在目标时间之前到达终点，\\r\\n就能获得参与奖。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "sub_006_trainer_10",
      "hash64": "B98EB26E5775B346",
      "text": "以刷新个人最佳纪录为目标，\\n全力以赴地滑行吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "sub_006_trainer_11",
      "hash64": "B98EB36E5775B4F9",
