      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "sub_006_trainer_18",
      "hash64": "B98EBA6E5775C0DE",
      "text": "恭喜你首次完成细雪赛道！\\n这是送给你的贺礼！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "sub_006_trainer_24",
      "hash64": "B98B486E5772C951",
      "text": "从下次起，你可以挑战\\n相当困难的暴风雪赛道了！\\r\\n要是有自信的话，就滑滑看吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "sub_006_trainer_19",
      "hash64": "B98EBB6E5775C291",
      "text": "恭喜你首次完成暴风雪赛道！\\n你已经是独当一面的滑行好手了！\\r\\n这是送给你的贺礼！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "sub_006_trainer_25",
      "hash64": "B98B476E5772C79E",
      "text": "从下次起，你可以挑战\\n最困难的绝对零度赛道了！\\r\\n要是有觉悟的话，就滑滑看吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "sub_006_trainer_20",
      "hash64": "B98B4C6E5772D01D",
      "text": "首次完成绝对零度赛道！恭喜！\\n你已经是顶天立地的雪山大师了！\\r\\n这是送给你的贺礼！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "sub_006_trainer_21",
      "hash64": "B98B4B6E5772CE6A",
      "text": "恭喜你刷新最佳时间！\\n真是漂亮的滑行！\\r\\n请收下纪念品！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "sub_006_trainer_22",
      "hash64": "B98B4A6E5772CCB7",
      "text": "恭喜你完成滑行！\\n请收下纪念品。\\r\\n下次去冲击更高的目标吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
